        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every bike shipped under our Bike Transportation In Dalkhola service is covered by 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. The policy protects against theft, accidental damage, and natural events throughout the 850 km journey. A copy of the insurance certificate is shared with you at the time of booking, and any claim is settled within 48 hours.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does live GPS tracking work for my bike during transportation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each of our specialized container trucks is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that streams real‑time location to our control center. You receive a secure link to view the bike’s exact position, speed, and estimated arrival time on a map. Alerts are triggered for any unscheduled stops, giving you full visibility and peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the difference between standard bike shipping and the cruiser &amp; sports bike shift service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard bike shipping uses our basic 4‑layer packing and standard trailer. The cruiser &amp; sports bike shift adds custom wooden crates, extra foam padding, and dedicated hydraulic ramps designed for high‑value or delicate frames. This premium service also includes priority handling, a dedicated driver, and a higher insurance limit, ensuring zero‑scratch delivery for premium motorcycles.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I schedule a doorstep pickup for my bike in Dalkhola?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our doorstep pickup is part of the end‑to‑end workflow. Once you confirm the quote, our trained technicians arrive at your address with the hydraulic ramp trailer, secure the bike using high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and load it into the enclosed container. You receive a photo‑proof of loading and a tracking ID for the entire journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike transportation from Dalkhola to major transport hubs typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of approximately 850 km via National Highway arterial corridors is covered in 12‑16 hours, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Our real‑time GPS updates provide exact ETA, and we aim for same‑day delivery to nearby hubs such as Siliguri, Kolkata, or Guwahati. Night‑time movements are also possible on request.</p>
      </div>
